hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"17678","Waki' narrated to us, from Sufyan, from 'Abd al-Rahman ibn Ziyad, from Ziyad ibn Nu'aym al-Hadrami, from Ziyad ibn al-Harith al-Suda'i, that he called the adhan, and Bilal wanted to perform the iqamah. The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: O brother of Suda', indeed he who called the adhan performs the iqamah."
